      "pdf_links_json": "https://dspace.lib.uom.gr/bitstream/2159/13392/2/KwstikisMsc2008.pdf",
      "metadata_json": "{\"Τίτλος\": \"Κάπνισμα κατά τη διάρκεια της εγκυμοσύνης και οι επιπτώσεις που έχει στο νεογνό\", \"Δημιουργός\": \"Σαββίδου, Μαρία\", \"Συντελεστής\": \"Κωνσταντίνου, Μαριάννα\", \"Τύπος\": \"bachelorThesis\", \"Ημερομηνία\": \"2020-09-07T06:09:42Z\", \"Χρονολογία\": \"2020 (EL)\", \"Περιγραφή\": \"In our days, a large percentage of women have the habit to smoke during the pregnancy, although they know that their actions can cause a lot of problems to them and the baby. The purpose of this study is the investigation of the consequences that smoking has on health and development of the baby.\\nMethod: The study is a systematic review. The method that has been used was the research of international bibliography from electronic database Pubmed/ Medline, Cinahl and Google Scholar. The research was about studies since 2015 and the key words that have been used were «smoking during pregnancy», «side effects», «infants», «tobacoo» with all the possible combinations using the word AND. The selection criteria were the English language, access to the whole article, satisfied number of specimen and the answers that were given was about the cause of the study.\\nResults: In this review were included 8 studies in total. Five of them were about the reduction of body weight and some of them were about the development of the fetus. The body weight of the newborn baby was seemed to be decreasing depending on the number of cigarettes that the mother has consumed, as well and the subsequent development. Moreover, 2 of the studies were about the development of bronchiolitis and one of them showed a strong connection between those two. Although the other one hasn’t shown a statistically significant difference. Also, the smoking has some affects on the congitive and language development and the physiology of stress of the baby.\\nConclusion: The smoking during the pregnancy seems that has some strong negative effects on the baby’s life in so many areas.\", \"Επιστημονικό πεδίο\": \"Ιατρική και Επιστήμες Υγείας ▶ Επιστήμες Υγείας Νοσηλευτική (EL)\", \"Θέμα\": \"Καπνός\", \"Γλώσσα\": \"Ελληνική γλώσσα\", \"Εκδότης\": \"Department of Nursing, Faculty of Health Sciences, Cyprus University of Technology\", \"Σχολή/Τμήμα/Ινστιτούτο\": \"Department of Nursing\", \"Δικαιώματα\": \"Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives 4.0 International\", \"Πάροχος\": \"Τεχνολογικό Πανεπιστήμιο Κύπρου\", \"Αποθετήριο / συλλογή\": \"Κτίσις\", \"Επιμέρους συλλογή\": \"Cyprus University of Technology Repository\"}",
